      "game": "Until Then",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/15891/450x258/until-then-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1787403600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/15891-buy-until-then-pc-steam/",
      "user": "H6UNT3R",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/30287191-1777640752.jpg",
      "sentiment": "dislike",
      "content": "I would like to request a refund for this game because I was unable to use it in my region. The game is not supported/available for activation in my region, so I cannot access or play the product I purchased. I would appreciate a refund for this purchase."
