    {
      "game": "MARVEL Tōkon: Fighting Souls Deluxe Edition",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/21927/450x258/marvel-tokon-fighting-souls-deluxe-edition-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1787403600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/21927-buy-marvel-tokon-fighting-souls-deluxe-edition-pc-steam/",
      "user": "gamer-a045573",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "dislike",
      "content": "I bought a game for €80 today, activated the key, and ended up with a game that is practically unplayable: extremely long loading times, major bugs, and, worst of all, the game sometimes completely disappears from my library. I have to restart my PC to make it appear again.\n\n\n\nI contacted the platform’s customer support, who told me that everything was up to date and that I should contact Instant Gaming. They specifically told me that the issue with the game disappearing from my library needs to be handled by Instant Gaming, which is why I reached out to them.\n\n\n\nHowever, all I keep getting told is that the key has been activated and that a refund is not possible. That’s not even what I’m asking for at this point — I just want a solution. Instead, I’m being sent back and forth between support services while I’m left with an €80 game that doesn’t work.\n\n\n\nI can understand that an activated key is normally non-refundable, but when the product is unusable and the issue is reported on the very same day of purchase, I expect some actual assistance and an attempt to resolve the problem.\n\n\n\nRight now, nobody seems willing to take responsibility, and I’m simply left with a game I can’t play after spending €80. Very disappointing experience."
    },
    {
      "game": "Operation: Tango",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/9374/450x258/operation-tango-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1787403600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/9374-buy-operation-tango-pc-steam/",
      "user": "Zarknox",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/16480527-1686341937.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Super jeu à faire à deux ! La communication et la coopération sont vraiment au centre du jeu, et les énigmes sont très sympas à résoudre ensemble. On s’est vraiment bien amusés du début à la fin. Je recommande clairement si vous cherchez un bon jeu coop à deux."
